      493.69,
      540.09,
      588.76
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul RauffHakeem, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, on the recommendation of the University GrantsCommission, do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1448/27 ofJune 09, 2006 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2025/39 of June 30, 2017) whichspecifies the Faculties and the Departments of the University of Colombo, Sri Lanka, which is deemed by virtue of theprovisions of Section 139 of the aforesaid Act, to be a University established under Section 21 of the said Act, by theaddition immediately after the entry \u201c17. Department of Allied Health Sciences\u201d appearing in Column II of the Schedulewhich corresponds to the entry \u201cFaculty of Medicine\u201d appearing in Column I of the Schedule, of the following entry :-",
